  "body_html": "<h1>VCG Welfare And Payments</h1>\n<p>The VCG interface defines social welfare for reported valuation profiles,\nefficient allocations, welfare without a given agent, Clarke-pivot payments,\nand the induced direct and transfer mechanisms.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[AGT, Chapter 9, Section 9.3.3, Def. 9.16] Nisan, Roughgarden,\n  Tardos, and Vazirani, <em>Algorithmic Game Theory</em>. VCG mechanisms and welfare-maximizing\n  allocation rules.</li>\n<li>[AGT, Chapter 9, Section 9.3.4, Def. 9.19] Nisan, Roughgarden,\n  Tardos, and Vazirani, <em>Algorithmic Game Theory</em>. Clarke-pivot payments.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Provenance</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Migrated from EconCSLib pull request 27, old blueprint label\n  <code>def:md_vcg_interface</code> in <code>blueprint/src/content.tex</code>.</li>\n</ul>",
